⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Hierarchy of Foreignness
node EN1 · EN1 · ⟦The Hierarchy of Foreignness:EN1:9a9c34⟧

WHO   — The Hierarchy of Foreignness — utlanning to varelse
WHAT  — Valentine's framework, written as Demosthenes, for ranking the Other — from stranger to monster.
WHERE — EN1 · Enderverse  Framework inputs: The Ender Quintet  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — It is the moral spine of the saga — most 'aliens' are raman if only we try, and war comes from mistaking raman for varelse.
HOW   — It sorts beings along a ladder of foreignness — utlanning, framling, raman, varelse, djur — by the possibility of understanding between them and us.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  The measure of a stranger is not how far they stand, but whether we can yet reach across to meet them.

